English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:INFO
Art. 1 Object
This Act regulates the effects, dissolution and conversion into marriage of registered partnerships between same-sex couples established before the Amendment of 18 December 2020 to the Civil Code comes fully into force.
